  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Frigid_Dread_Mantis.png\" title=\"Crypolyn Kaptcher\"><img alt=\"Crypolyn Kaptcher\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"286\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Frigid_Dread_Mantis.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Frigid_Dread_Mantis.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Crypolyn Kaptcher</div></div></div>\n<p>Crypolyn Kaptcher is the first Hero you will encounter in <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>.  He appears as a giant bug surrounded by various minions.  He is released from behind his gate when the Fade Machine is destroyed.\n</p><p>Crypolyn appears to be immune to Shadow damage, but Ice and Fire worked well against him.\n</p><p>He used to drop good loot, but in Build 122 he does not even drop Champion loot.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
